    "q-73451": {
      "dom_id": "step-q73451",
      "name": "Question 5",
      "problem": "Find $a\\cdot (b\\times c)$ given that $a=⟨-5,2,3⟩$ and $b\\times c=⟨1,-5,4⟩.$",
      "worked_solution": "Substituting given vectors into the formula for the scalar triple product, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot (b\\times c) & =⟨-5,2,3⟩\\cdot ⟨1,-5,4⟩ \\\\  & =(-5)\\cdot 1+2\\cdot (-5)+3\\cdot 4 \\\\  & =-3.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
